title: 'spec-msg: align with design v0.6 and instrument delivery'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Aligns `cumulus-primitives-spec-messaging` with the Speculative Messaging v0.6 design.
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    Adds `parachain_spec_msg_*` Prometheus metrics to spec-msg-enabled omni-nodes for
    finalized outbound Data messages, receiver confirmations, pending messages and their age,
    and logical fetch outcomes versus individual peer attempts. Delivery means receiver enqueueing;
    application execution is separate. Counts cover sends finalized after a process-local baseline,
    which resets on restart. Incomplete delivery accounting suppresses the delivery metrics until
    restart. See `cumulus/client/spec-msg/src/metrics.rs` for labels and queries.
crates:
- name: cumulus-primitives-spec-messaging
  bump: major
- name: cumulus-client-spec-msg
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: patch
